  "description": "Find the number of paths to move the ball out of the m x n grid boundaries in maxMove steps.",
  "target": 6,
  "pseudocode": "1. dp = Array(m).fill().map(() => Array(n).fill(0))\n2. dp[startRow][startCol] = 1\n3. for step = 1 to maxMove:\n4.   newDp = Array(m).fill().map(() => Array(n).fill(0))\n5.   for r = 0 to m-1:\n6.     for c = 0 to n-1:\n7.       if dp[r][c] > 0:\n8.         for each direction [dr, dc]:\n9.           nr, nc = r+dr, c+dc\n10.          if out(nr, nc): count += dp[r][c]\n11.          else: newDp[nr][nc] += dp[r][c]\n12.  dp = newDp",
